{"id":"02bcc9140b83afbe","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-infinitary-derivability.md","title":"可数分支验证与 NTω₁","display":"df-infinitary-derivability — 可数分支验证与 NTω₁","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-infinitary-derivability","aliases":["18-df-infinitary-derivability"],"display":"df-infinitary-derivability — 可数分支验证与 NTω₁","depends_on":["[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","[[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]","[[18-df-infinitary-operations]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§8.2 equation (8.1); Definition 8.3.1, extending Definition 7.3.5","source_pages":"133,135;112","source_pdf_pages":"143,145;122","verification_status":"source-definition-and-local-recursion-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-infinitary-derivability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-infinitary-derivability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinitary-derivability — 可数分支验证与 NTω₁"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fab9ed41cc227c08\" href=\"?note=fab9ed41cc227c08\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-semantics\">18-df-infinitary-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"392bd14777be34cd\" href=\"?note=392bd14777be34cd\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-operations\">18-df-infinitary-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.2 equation (8.1); Definition 8.3.1, extending Definition 7.3.5"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"133,135;112"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"143,145;122"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-local-recursion-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\">\\(0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\mathcal L_\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\mathcal L_\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\rho\">\\(\\alpha,\\rho\\)</span> 为序数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\kappa,\\mathsf a,\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty,\\sim_\\infty,\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\kappa,\\mathsf a,\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa,\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty,\\sim_\\infty,\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"392bd14777be34cd\" href=\"?note=392bd14777be34cd\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-operations\">18-df-infinitary-operations</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fab9ed41cc227c08\" href=\"?note=fab9ed41cc227c08\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-semantics\">18-df-infinitary-semantics</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[E]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([E]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为有穷子集族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span> 为闭项集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}\\)</span> 为闭项求值，精确来源是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa^\\alpha\">\\(V_\\kappa^\\alpha\\)</span> 按高度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 超限递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha\">\\(D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha\\)</span> 仅用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega_1\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega_1\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 固定后按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 超限递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty\\)</span> 由下式定义；记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}_{\\omega_1}\\vdash_\\rho^\\alpha\\Delta\">\\(\\mathrm{NT}_{\\omega_1}\\vdash_\\rho^\\alpha\\Delta\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\">\\(D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\)</span> 的别名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\ \\exists X\\in\\mathcal X\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\land\n\\{\\mathsf a(s\\in X),\\mathsf a(t\\notin X)\\}\\subseteq\\Delta\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\ \\exists X\\in\\mathcal X\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{val}(s)=\\operatorname{val}(t)\\land\n\\{\\mathsf a(s\\in X),\\mathsf a(t\\notin X)\\}\\subseteq\\Delta\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nV_\\kappa^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty(\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ V_\\kappa^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ V_\\kappa^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nV_\\kappa^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty(\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{CType}_\\kappa\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ V_\\kappa^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{DType}_\\kappa\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ V_\\kappa^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty(\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{CType}_{\\omega_1}\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{DType}_{\\omega_1}\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)&lt;\\rho\\land\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\})\\land\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\sim_\\infty F\\})\\bigr)\n\\qquad(\\Delta\\in[\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}]^{&lt;\\omega}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Ax}_\\infty(\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{CType}_{\\omega_1}\\ \\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\Delta\\cap\\mathrm{DType}_{\\omega_1}\\ \\exists i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F))\\\n\\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\mathrm{CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists F\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\ \\exists\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)&lt;\\rho\\land\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\})\\land\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\sim_\\infty F\\})\\bigr)\n\\qquad(\\Delta\\in[\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}]^{&lt;\\omega}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}_{\\omega_1}\\vdash_\\rho^\\alpha\\Delta\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NT}_{\\omega_1}\\vdash_\\rho^\\alpha\\Delta\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty,0}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow V_{\\omega_1}^\\alpha(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\infty,0}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow V_{\\omega_1}^\\alpha(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\exists F\\in\\Delta\\ (\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty F[\\Phi]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\exists F\\in\\Delta\\ (\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty F[\\Phi]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书在 §8.2 明确把 Definition 5.4.3 的规则逐字移到分支语言，在 Definition 8.3.1 把 Definition 7.3.5 的带切系统移到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\)</span>。本节点给出全部具体分支，而非把新系统隐藏在一个给定规则集参数里。临界公式继续保留在相继式中；切公式可以不在结论内。分支量词遍历特征序列的实际序数域，不误缩为自然数索引。</p>\n<p>右式所有递归调用的高度严格减小，确定唯一关系；每个固定高度和切秩的定义域都是同一有限公式集载体。切秩为 0 时切分支不可能，按高度归纳得到与验证演算的等价。可靠性也对高度归纳：公理使用相同数值的成员对；若结论全假，合取规则迫使全部分支为真，析取规则迫使某一分支为真；切规则则迫使公式及其对偶同时为真。空分支按空全称/空存在处理，所以真数值原子及空合取可在高度 0 验证，空析取不能独立验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"fab9ed41cc227c08","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-operations","status":"resolved","id":"392bd14777be34cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-infinitary-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-operations","status":"resolved","id":"392bd14777be34cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1$，$\\Delta\\in[\\mathcal L_\\kappa]^{<\\omega}$；$\\alpha,\\rho$ 为序数。$\\mathc