CS}_\\infty(F)(i)\\})\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists F\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\ \\exists\\beta<\\alpha\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty(F)<\\rho\\land\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{F\\})\\land\nD_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\beta(\\Delta\\cup\\{\\sim_\\infty F\\})\\bigr)\n\\qquad(\\Delta\\in[\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}]^{<\\omega}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}_{\\omega_1}\\vdash_\\rho^\\alpha\\Delta\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta).","display":true},{"tex":"D_{\\infty,0}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\leftrightarrow V_{\\omega_1}^\\alpha(\\Delta).","display":true},{"tex":"D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\exists F\\in\\Delta\\ (\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty F[\\Phi]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}","display":false}],"bytes":4413,"backlinks":[{"id":"c8f3a8371faa8691","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha<\\omega_1$。$\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 的数变量模板、代入、对偶和秩见 [[18-df-infinitary-operations]]；标准解释见 [[18-df-infinitary-semantics]]；$D_{\\infty,\\rho}^\\xi$ 见 [[18-df-infinitary-derivability]]。$u=x_0,v=x_1$ 是不同数变量，$X_0$ 是固定集变量，$\\eta_0$ 为全零数赋值，$\\Phi_0(X)=\\varnothing$ 为全空集赋值。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-infinitary-derivability]]"},{"id":"85ef9f58d72ef99a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 的关系，$\\varphi$ 为 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]] 的 Veblen 函数，序数算术按 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]] 及其上游。另取 $\\Sigma\\in[\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}]^{<\\omega}$，$D_{\\infty,\\eta}^{\\xi}$ 为 [[18-df-infinitary-derivability]] 的可数分支系统，其切秩按序数函数 $\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty$ 控制。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-infinitary-derivability]]"},{